READING: circle I (integer) threshold = N*K is UNIVERSAL (K smallest speeds
nest at origin). Circle II (half) needs N even (evens nest at q/2). The 84
of N=14 is 6*14 with K=6; the two-circle count formula generalizes with N*K.
